126
00:12:03.895 --> 00:12:05.313
- Queen!
- Ah, Fred's not on it,

127
00:12:05.647 --> 00:12:06.874
and none of the kids, so - Joyce?

128
00:12:06.898 --> 00:12:08.458
I thought maybe they'd
come down here.

129
00:12:08.608 --> 00:12:09.817
Joyce?

130
00:12:10.151 --> 00:12:11.151
