141
00:12:50.984 --> 00:12:51.984
And rest.

142
00:12:52.151 --> 00:12:53.778
Is Tommy home?

143
00:12:54.112 --> 00:12:55.112
Soon.

144
00:13:31.941 --> 00:13:32.941
Okay, let's go, c'mon.

145
00:13:36.195 --> 00:13:37.548
I really don't
think it's anything

146
00:13:37.572 --> 00:13:39.115
