147
00:13:39.449 --> 00:13:41.617
Yeah, I'd rather just take a
look for myself, though.

148
00:13:41.951 --> 00:13:43.786
Sure.

149
00:13:44.120 --> 00:13:45.120
It's strange.

150
00:13:46.039 --> 00:13:47.915
They couldn't have
just disappeared.

151
