156
00:14:54.440 --> 00:14:55.440
Harry?

157
00:14:56.984 --> 00:14:58.820
Harry, Sheriff Hart here.

158
00:14:59.153 --> 00:15:00.196
Come in, Harry.

159
00:15:01.656 --> 00:15:02.782
Dammit Harry, answer me.

160
00:15:05.243 --> 00:15:06.243
Yeah, Billy.

161
00:15:07.578 --> 00:15:08.597
Are you still out at
the MacKenzie place?

162
00:15:08.621 --> 00:15:09.621
