165
00:15:16.003 --> 00:15:17.296
How long have I been here?

166
00:15:17.630 --> 00:15:19.390
Billy, I just been talkin'
for a few minutes.

167
00:15:19.465 --> 00:15:21.505
Dammit, Harry, just give me
some straight answers.

168
00:15:21.551 --> 00:15:23.136
I don't wanna dock your pay.

169
00:15:23.469 --> 00:15:25.596
Did you see the school
bus pass there?

170
00:15:25.930 --> 00:15:27.223
