the Gould place.

179
00:15:42.822 --> 00:15:46.117
Motor's still running but no
Fred and no kids.

180
00:15:48.786 --> 00:15:50.496
Is your brother home
from school yet?

181
00:15:50.830 --> 00:15:51.830
Paul?

182
00:15:52.790 --> 00:15:53.791
No, he isn't home yet.

183
00:15:57.086 --> 00:15:58.230
Well, now Sheriff, now
how could the bus

184
00:15:58.254 --> 00:15:59.731
have gotten all the way down
to where you are

185
00:15:59.755 --> 00:16:01.132
without us seein' it?

186
00:16:01.466 --> 00:16:02.675
- Harry?
- Sheriff.

187
00:16:04.218 --> 00:16:06.138
Get out to the interstate,
set up a road block.

188
00:16:06.220 --> 00:16:07.739
I don't want anything goin'
out of here

189
00:16:07.763 --> 00:16:08.431
