you understand?

190
00:16:08.764 --> 00:16:09.764
- Yes, sir.
- And nobody

191
00:16:09.807 --> 00:16:11.047
comes in unless they live here.

192
00:16:13.019 --> 00:16:15.021
I'll, I'll send a couple of
boys out to you

193
00:16:15.354 --> 00:16:16.354
