194
00:16:16.647 --> 00:16:18.316
Alright, Billy, I'm on my way.

195
00:16:42.256 --> 00:16:43.341
Bye.

196
00:16:59.106 --> 00:17:00.106
Tommy?

197
00:17:01.108 --> 00:17:02.652
Okay, at least the bus

198
00:17:02.985 --> 00:17:04.305
