199
00:17:04.403 --> 00:17:05.756
I don't know where the
hell they could be.

200
00:17:05.780 --> 00:17:07.657
It doesn't make a whole lot
of sense, you know?

201
00:17:07.990 --> 00:17:08.574
I know.

202
00:17:08.908 --> 00:17:10.034
