Tommy's missing.

209
00:17:24.423 --> 00:17:25.423
Don't tell her.

210
00:17:26.133 --> 00:17:27.843
That's one way to deal with it.

211
00:17:29.136 --> 00:17:30.846
I'll be in touch.

212
00:17:31.180 --> 00:17:32.223
Yeah, thanks.

