224
00:19:34.178 --> 00:19:35.738
Come on, Molly, it's a
beautiful bird.

225
00:19:35.971 --> 00:19:36.971
Skinny little birds.

226
00:19:37.223 --> 00:19:38.450
Molly, if you want
'em any bigger,

227
00:19:38.474 --> 00:19:39.493
