267
00:21:09.523 --> 00:21:12.485
Well, damn, that's
not like Fred.

268
00:21:12.818 --> 00:21:14.528
He wouldn't leave that
motor runnin'.

269
00:21:14.862 --> 00:21:16.089
Yeah, I know.

270
00:21:16.113 --> 00:21:16.739
My God.

271
00:21:17.072 --> 00:21:18.240
- I wonder why?
